    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "settings": {
        "caption": "Common questions",
        "heading": "Before you order",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "layout": "section",
        "container_color_scheme": "scheme-2",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "open_first_collapsible_row": true,
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "desktop_layout": "image_second",
        "padding_top": 52,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      },
      "blocks": {
        "faq-sizing": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which size should I order?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "row_content": "<p>Order the size that matches your usual shoe size. If you are between sizes, or you wear a wide fit, size up. Every product page lists its size range, and our <a href=\"/pages/sizing-guide\">Sizing Guide</a> walks you through measuring your foot. If you are still unsure, email us your shoe size and we will tell you which to pick.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days. Standard US delivery then typically takes 5–8 business days, and shipping is free on orders over $50. You will get a tracking link by email as soon as your parcel ships.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-returns": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I return something?",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The full terms, including the return window and how to start a return, are on our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund policy</a> page. If you are unsure whether an item will fit, email us before ordering and we will help you choose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-materials": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are they made of?",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Most insoles use an EVA foam base with a softer top layer and a breathable fabric cover. Compression socks are a nylon and spandex knit. Supports use a stretch fabric with an open-knit panel behind the joint. The exact materials for each item are listed on its product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-shoes": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will insoles fit in my shoes?",
            "icon": "shoe",
            "row_content": "<p>They are made to sit inside everyday sneakers, work boots and most closed shoes, and are trim-to-fit so you can cut them along the printed guide lines. They are a tight fit in dress shoes and flats with a shallow footbed — if that is what you wear most, choose one of our low-profile options.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq-sizing",
        "faq-shipping",
        "faq-returns",
        "faq-materials",
        "faq-shoes"
      ]
    },
